 "rules": [
  {
   "section": "Design rules 8.3",
   "text": "**Three gaps only:** tight `--tm-space-sm` (8): label↔field, field↔helper, and a result notice ↔ the control it came from · related `--tm-space-lg` (16): items within a group, **and cards stacked one above another — the same gap everywhere cards stack, on the case page, Prescribe and Profile** · section `--tm-space-2xl` (32): between groups. Spare vertical space goes between the content and a pinned button, never inside a group. Home-base screens use 3xl (48) as the hero gap between logo and title."
  },
  {
   "section": "Design rules L4",
   "text": "L4 — Field helper and field error text: 14/20 (`.tm-field__helper`)."
  },
  {
   "section": "Design rules L7",
   "text": "L7 — Field helper/error text aligns with its field: left under full-width fields, centred under the centred OTP code boxes (D-47)."
  },
  {
   "section": "Design rules 9.5",
   "text": "**Field error** — Under the field (L4, L7)."
  },
  {
   "section": "Design rules 9.8",
   "text": "**Visible focus ring** on buttons, links and tappable rows. Text fields and the OTP code show focus with their own border (no outline on top); a sheet or screen focused by script shows no outline (D-54)."
  }
